Package: balancR
Type: Package
Title: A tool for data balancing and scaling analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Milos", family = "Simovic", email = "milos.simovic@botany.ubc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")), person(given = "Sean T.", family = "Michaletz", email = "sean.michaletz@ubc.ca", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides tools for balancing imbalanced data in scaling analyses using
    bootstrapping, and for comparing regression coefficients (slopes and intercepts)
    between original and balanced samples.
